@startuml
title Milestone 3B - create and first DRC REST interaction
actor Recorder
participant Gateway
participant "Operations application" as O
participant "Estate REST" as E
database "Operations DB" as D
Recorder -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/tapping/collections\nJWT + Idempotency-Key + weight
Gateway -> O : existing wildcard route; bearer/key/correlation
O -> O : authenticate + authorize execution owner/estate
O -> D : look up successful command receipt
alt exact authorized replay
 D --> O : original status/body/Location
 O --> Recorder : original receipt
else new command
 O -> E : bounded authenticated GET estate and block
 E --> O : active RUBBER ownership, zone/division/version
 O -> D : BEGIN; reserve actor/key; recheck eligible execution
 O -> D : root + revision 0 + v2 outbox + receipt
 O -> D : COMMIT
 O --> Recorder : 201 pending collection + Location
end
Recorder -> Gateway : POST /collections/{id}/drc-measurements\nmanagement JWT + key + version + measured evidence
Gateway -> O : forward request
O -> O : authorize, replay lookup, validate decimal/time/source
O -> D : BEGIN; reserve; conditional root update by version
alt version matched
 O -> D : immutable measurement + revision + outbox + receipt
 O -> D : COMMIT
 O --> Recorder : 200 calculated quantity
else stale
 O -> D : ROLLBACK
 O --> Recorder : 409 ProblemDetail
end
note over O,D : No broker publication on the HTTP transaction thread.
@enduml
